{"type":"standard","title":"James Gallagher (California politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">James Gallagher (California politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q18686250","titles":{"canonical":"James_Gallagher_(California_politician)","normalized":"James Gallagher (California politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">James Gallagher (California politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":44514311,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/James_Gallagher%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg/330px-James_Gallagher%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/James_Gallagher%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":600,"height":750},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1374136895","tid":"14071492-acbd-11f1-ac6a-5e51fce3514d","timestamp":"2026-09-10T02:12:31Z","description":"American politician (born 1981)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Gallagher_(California_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Gallagher_(California_politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Gallagher_(California_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:James_Gallagher_(California_politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Gallagher_(California_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/James_Gallagher_(California_politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Gallagher_(California_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:James_Gallagher_(California_politician)"}},"extract":"James Matthew Gallagher is an American politician who has served as the U.S. representative from California's 1st congressional district since 2026. A member of the Republican Party, he previously served in the California State Assembly from 2014 to 2026, representing the 3rd district located in the northern Sacramento Valley. Gallagher served as the Minority Leader of the California State Assembly from 2022 to 2025.","extract_html":"<p><b>James Matthew Gallagher</b> is an American politician who has served as the U.S. representative from California's 1st congressional district since 2026. A member of the Republican Party, he previously served in the California State Assembly from 2014 to 2026, representing the 3rd district located in the northern Sacramento Valley. Gallagher served as the Minority Leader of the California State Assembly from 2022 to 2025.</p>"}